  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how are things going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.7,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.78,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My husband and I are glued to our phones all weekend. I want to change that.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.28,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a lovely goal. Try a simple rule, like no phones during meals or on walks.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "He'll moan.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Make it a game rather than a rule. Phones in a basket, and whoever checks first does the dishes.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ha, he'd lose instantly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then you'd get clean dishes and his attention. Win win.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What do we",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg21"
  },
